<title>USA: First Savings/Washington buyback approved.</title>
<headline>First Savings/Washington buyback approved.</headline>
<dateline>WALLA WALLA, Wash. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Savings Bank of Washington Bancorp Inc said its board approved a continuance of its repurchase program and the repurchase of up to 10 percent of its total shares outstanding over the next 12 months.</p>
<p>It also said it completed its five percent stock repurchase program announced in April.  As of November 19, 1996, the company had purchased 545,525 shares, or five percent of its outstanding common stock in open market transactions.</p>
</text>
